<title>USA: ABR Information sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>ABR Information sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>PALM HARBOR, Fla. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABR Information Services Inc said on Wednesday that it has declared a two-for-one stock split payable February 19, 1997 to shareholders of record at the close of business February 3, 1997.</p>
<p>The stock split will increase the number of outstanding shares to 27.4 million, ABR said.</p>
